    "content": "Net domestic investment (by government and private industry in structures, equipment, software and inventory) increased from a very low 5.2 percent of NNP in 1991 to 10.3 per cent in the first quarter of 2000. A large portion of this investment has been financed from abroad, as U.S. net foreign investment swung from 0.3 per cent of NNP in 1991 to -4.6 percent in the first quarter.",
